WEBVTT

00:00:08.627 --> 00:00:12.787
(RALPH READING ALOUD)

00:00:12.907 --> 00:00:14.307
Yeah! Check it out. Look!

00:00:18.827 --> 00:00:19.827
Oh!

00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:22.387
Ow! Whoa!

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:24.147
You got to watch out for the splash.

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:25.987
That stuff is broiling hot.

00:00:26.107 --> 00:00:27.627
RALPH: Yeah, I got that. Thank you.

00:00:28.787 --> 00:00:30.027
What is this dump?

00:00:30.187 --> 00:00:33.827
I think it's some sort of
unfinished bonus level.

00:00:34.147 --> 00:00:35.867
Yeah. It's pretty cool, huh?

00:00:36.027 --> 00:00:39.467
I found that secret opening,
and now I live here.

00:00:39.587 --> 00:00:41.267
See? Oh, look, look, look.

00:00:42.147 --> 00:00:44.267
Welcome to my home!

00:00:44.827 --> 00:00:46.827
I sleep in these candy wrappers.

00:00:46.947 --> 00:00:49.947
I bundle myself up like
a little homeless lady.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:52.467
By yourself?

00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:55.387
With all this garbage around you?

00:00:56.627 --> 00:00:58.467
Well, yeah.

00:00:58.627 --> 00:01:00.667
I mean, everyone here
says I'm just a mistake

00:01:00.787 --> 00:01:02.827
and that I wasn't
even supposed to exist.

00:01:02.987 --> 00:01:04.507
What do you expect?

00:01:04.827 --> 00:01:07.027
Listen, kid...

00:01:07.187 --> 00:01:09.467
I know it's none of my business

00:01:09.627 --> 00:01:12.267
but why do you even
stick around this game?

00:01:12.507 --> 00:01:14.507
You really don't know anything, do you?

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:16.867
Glitches can't leave their games.

00:01:18.347 --> 00:01:21.707
It's one of the joys of being me.

00:01:30.307 --> 00:01:32.027
Hey, what are you doing? Come on!

00:01:32.787 --> 00:01:35.187
I know it's a dump, but it's all I got.

00:01:35.347 --> 00:01:36.707
If you're going to be a racer,

00:01:36.787 --> 00:01:38.147
you're going to have
to learn how to drive.

00:01:38.627 --> 00:01:41.347
And you can't do that without a track.

00:01:45.867 --> 00:01:47.027
Whoa!

00:01:47.227 --> 00:01:48.627
All right, now.

00:01:48.707 --> 00:01:50.387
Let's hustle up.
We've got some driving to do.

00:01:50.467 --> 00:01:52.987
I'm going to learn to drive!
I'm going to learn to drive!

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:54.387
Oh, wait. Do you know how to drive?

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.547
Yeah! I mean, I haven't done it, but...

00:01:56.707 --> 00:01:58.307
Look, I flew a spaceship today, okay?

00:01:58.387 --> 00:01:59.387
You crashed it.

00:01:59.747 --> 00:02:02.107
Just get in. How hard can it be?
Okay, uh...

00:02:02.627 --> 00:02:03.987
Start it up.

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:06.147
(ENGINE STARTING)

00:02:06.227 --> 00:02:09.867
There we go. So there are
some buttons on the floor.

00:02:09.987 --> 00:02:11.747
-Pedals.
-Pedals. Right.

00:02:11.907 --> 00:02:16.547
Now, uh, that's the go pedal.

00:02:16.987 --> 00:02:20.667
That I believe is the stopper.

00:02:21.027 --> 00:02:23.667
And this... Wait.

00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:26.267
What is this? That doesn't do anything.

00:02:26.347 --> 00:02:27.907
Ooh, what does this joystick do?

00:02:28.907 --> 00:02:31.667
Okay, good. Let's try that again.

00:02:31.747 --> 00:02:34.187
I've been looking
for a driver who's qualified

00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:36.027
So if you think that you're the one

00:02:36.107 --> 00:02:37.147
Ow!

00:02:37.227 --> 00:02:38.467
To step into my ride

00:02:38.547 --> 00:02:40.267
I'm a fine-tuned supersonic
speed machine

00:02:40.427 --> 00:02:41.427
Ow!

00:02:41.747 --> 00:02:43.507
With a sunroof top and a gangster lean

00:02:43.587 --> 00:02:44.627
Ow!

00:02:46.107 --> 00:02:49.267
So if you feel me
let me know, know, know

00:02:49.387 --> 00:02:50.467
Ow!

00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:53.267
So start me up
and watch me go, go, go, go

00:02:53.347 --> 00:02:55.907
Get you where you wanna go
If you know what I mean

00:02:56.747 --> 00:02:59.707
Got a ride that's smoother
than a limousine

00:02:59.907 --> 00:03:01.867
'Cause I'm 0 to 60 in three point five

00:03:01.947 --> 00:03:03.027
Now shift it.

00:03:03.467 --> 00:03:05.187
Baby you got the keys

00:03:05.267 --> 00:03:07.107
That's good. Keep going! Shift it again!

00:03:07.227 --> 00:03:10.467
Now shut up and drive
Drive, drive, drive

00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:12.267
(VANELLOPE LAUGHING)

00:03:12.427 --> 00:03:15.467
I told you, racing's in my code!

00:03:15.547 --> 00:03:17.227
So if you feel me
let me know, know, know

00:03:17.307 --> 00:03:18.387
(CHUCKLING)

00:03:18.467 --> 00:03:20.067
I got that medal in the bag!

00:03:20.147 --> 00:03:22.307
Hey, Ralphie, watch this!

00:03:22.427 --> 00:03:24.987
Get you where you wanna go
if you know what I mean

00:03:25.107 --> 00:03:27.707
Got a ride that's smoother
than a limousine

00:03:27.787 --> 00:03:29.307
Whoo-hoo!

00:03:29.827 --> 00:03:32.307
Cause I'm zero to 60 in three point five

00:03:33.147 --> 00:03:35.947
Baby you got the keys

00:03:36.507 --> 00:03:37.827
-Look out!
-Whoa!

00:03:41.747 --> 00:03:43.107
Shut up and drive

00:03:43.187 --> 00:03:44.267
Ah!

00:03:48.187 --> 00:03:49.267
Hot cola!

00:03:52.667 --> 00:03:54.507
Now shut up and drive

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:55.747
So how did I do?

00:03:55.827 --> 00:03:56.987
Um...

00:03:57.347 --> 00:03:59.347
Well, you almost blew up
the whole mountain.

00:04:00.667 --> 00:04:02.067
Right, right. That's a good note.

00:04:02.267 --> 00:04:04.347
You got to get that
glitch under control, kid.

00:04:04.507 --> 00:04:05.867
Okay, I will, I will.

00:04:06.507 --> 00:04:08.827
And then you think I got a chance?

00:04:10.187 --> 00:04:11.227
Um...

00:04:11.627 --> 00:04:12.707
Tiny.

00:04:12.827 --> 00:04:14.547
Yes, I'm going to win!

00:04:14.627 --> 00:04:16.547
I'm going to win! I'm going to win!

00:04:16.667 --> 00:04:18.547
-Top shelf.
-Top shelf.

00:04:29.467 --> 00:04:30.467
(GASPS)

00:04:30.827 --> 00:04:33.027
Did you find her?
Tell me you found her.

00:04:35.067 --> 00:04:36.067
You didn't?

00:04:36.787 --> 00:04:37.787
(LAUGHS HOPELESSLY)

00:04:38.627 --> 00:04:40.627
Go. Leave me.

00:04:44.267 --> 00:04:45.467
(DOOR CLOSES)

00:05:02.067 --> 00:05:03.467
Up, up, down, down...

00:05:03.547 --> 00:05:05.467
(MUMBLING)

00:05:06.307 --> 00:05:07.307
Start!

00:05:10.267 --> 00:05:14.307
Oh, the code. It's the sweet
lifeblood of the game.

00:05:20.427 --> 00:05:25.027
Where are you? Let's see...
Stadium, no. Jumbotron.

00:05:25.507 --> 00:05:28.947
Ha-ha! There it is. The winner's cup.

00:05:31.147 --> 00:05:34.387
One of these things is
not like the others... It's you!

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:37.307
We're going to give you
a nice new home.

00:05:49.267 --> 00:05:50.387
Success!

00:05:50.467 --> 00:05:52.307
(CHUCKLING)

00:05:52.547 --> 00:05:54.147
Sour Bill, I'm going out.

00:05:54.307 --> 00:05:56.627
You're in charge of the castle
until I get back.

